    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"Event.cs.1846","source":"The crystal ball has moved on... Now I see you harvesting a plump, ripe melon. You're on a wonderful looking farm, bursting with life!","translation":"水晶球的景象繼續變化……現在我看見你正採收一顆飽滿成熟的甜瓜。你身處一座美麗的農場，處處充滿生機！"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"Event.cs.1849","source":"The crystal ball has moved on... Now I see you relaxing on the riverbanks, holding a fishing pole. Oh! Looks like something big is on the line!","translation":"水晶球的景象繼續變化……現在我看見你手持釣竿，在河岸邊悠閒休息。哦！看來有個大傢伙上鉤了！"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"Event.cs.1852","source":"Ah... the crystal ball has gone dim. That's all I can do for you, young one.","translation":"啊……水晶球暗了下來。年輕人，我能替你做的就這麼多。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"Event.cs.1853","source":"Now, just keep in mind that the future isn't set in stone! Whatever I've told you today can still be changed, if you set your heart on it. Farewell.","translation":"記住，未來並非一成不變！只要你下定決心，我今天告訴你的事仍然可以改變。再會。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"Event.cs.1857","source":"You added {0} to the soup.","translation":"你把{0}加進了湯裡。"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"Event.cs.1862","source":"Abigail!","translation":"阿比蓋爾！"},
    {"target":"Strings/StringsFromCSFiles","key":"Event.cs.1864","source":"It's a tie between","translation":"平手的是"},
